=====

COMPONENTS
    general libraries:
crystallography.py              cell, atoms, element data, coordinate conversions
umd_processes_fast.py           reading and writing of UMD files (C library c_UMDprocess), POSCAR files

    parsers, conversion and building:
VaspParser.py                   VASP OUTCAR -> UMD
AbinitParser.py                 ABINIT molecular dynamics output -> UMD
CP2KParser.py                   CP2K positions, velocities, forces, energies, stress and cell files -> UMD
QBoxParser.py                   QBox output -> UMD (not yet updated to the current package)
LAMMPSParser2umd.py             LAMMPS dump and log -> UMD
repair_umd.py                   repairs UMD files written by older versions of VaspParser.py
umd2out.py                      UMD -> extended XYZ, POSCAR, LAMMPS data and dump, DeepMD
build_umd.py                    new structures from a UMD snapshot, a POSCAR or an empty box; trajectories of selected atoms
check_umd.py                    quality checks of a run
umd_workflow.py                 automated workflow: runs the basic scripts of the structural (-g), transport (-t), thermodynamic (-d) panels (not those marked advanced),
                                one summary table of the results per folder
umd_clean.py                    removes the outputs of the package from a folder, to start afresh (lists them; -y moves them aside)

    structural properties:
gofr_umd.py                     pair distribution functions of all pairs or of central-adjacent elements (C library c_gofr)
analyze_gofr.py                 first maxima, minima and coordination numbers; bond cutoffs
bonding_umd.py                  bonds of every snapshot (C library c_bonds_full)
speciation_and_angles.py        chemical species, angles, bond lifetimes (C library c_clusters)
rotations_umd.py                (advanced) orientations of molecular units (H2O, NH3, CH4, OH, SO4...): correlations between units and in time, orientation map, entropy of translation and rotation (2PT)
lifetimes.py                    plots of the lifetimes of the species
stat-concentrate.py             (advanced) liquid/vapor partitioning over several runs
exchange_umd.py                 exchange of atoms between a condensed phase and the gas (or between two condensed phases, -c) through their interface: states, paths, exchanges, fluxes and equilibrium, gas pressure and composition, partition, molecules; liquid and vapor species (-P)
composition_umd.py              compositional fluctuations: atoms counted in a grid of sub-cells; local composition and density against ideal mixing, correlations of the elements, voids and bubbles, droplets, partition between gas and condensed phase, lifetimes of the heterogeneities

    transport properties:
msd_umd.py                      mean square displacements, diffusion coefficients and tensor
msd_clusters_umd.py             (advanced) mean square displacements of chemical species
msrd_umd.py                     (advanced) mean square relative displacements of the bonds of coordination polyhedra (SiO4, MgO6...): along and across each bond, in the frame of the cell and of the polyhedron; static EXAFS values
analyze_msd.py                  diffusion coefficients from MSD files
analyze_msd_clusters.py         (advanced) diffusion coefficients of chemical species
viscosity_umd.py                shear viscosity (Green-Kubo)

    thermodynamic properties:
averages.py                     averages and errors of any quantity; full thermodynamics and heat capacity (-a)
vibrations_umd.py               velocity autocorrelation functions, vibrational densities of states, diffusion
vdos_thermo.py                  harmonic and 2PT thermodynamics, quantum corrections
thermo_integration_umd.py       free energy and entropy by thermodynamic integration

    validation folder:
run_validation.py               runs the scripts on reference runs (data/, not distributed) and on synthetic files with exact answers,
                                and compares the results with the committed references (see validation/README)
cases.py, probes.py, synthetic.py   the cases, the readers of the outputs, the synthetic files ; reference/ one file per case

    gui folder (set aside, not maintained, does not run):
UMD_GUI.py, averages_forGUI.py, val_extract_umd.py

    documentation folder:
umd-flowchart.svg/.pdf/.png      flowchart of the scripts and their files (make_flowchart.py rebuilds it)
umd-quick-help.pdf/.html         two pages: each script in the order of the workflow, its command and its outputs
arxiv-jove-UMDpaper.pdf          the UMD paper (arXiv version of the J. Vis. Exp. article)
Figure-umd-flowchart.ai/.png     the flowchart of the paper (2021)


